# Clause 4: Context of the Organisation

## Overview
Clause 4 establishes the requirements for understanding the organisation's context and determining relevant interested parties and their information security requirements.

## Gaps in this Clause

| Gap | Title | Risk | Status |
|-----|-------|------|--------|
| GAP-001 | Context Analysis | HIGH | Not Implemented |
| GAP-002 | Interested Parties | HIGH | Not Implemented |

## Key Requirements

- Determine internal and external issues relevant to information security
- Identify interested parties and their requirements
- Establish strategic direction for information security
- Document and communicate context and requirements

## Remediation Priority

**URGENT** — Both gaps are High Risk and foundational to the entire ISMS. These must be addressed immediately.
